ee94e6cd684c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c63a5f967d6340d200c661107fff7bdd, https://si.imgix.net/1b790901/uploads/origins/d160404d-e724-49ed-86c2-ee94e6cd684c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=74c11710baf1b8bf3289b924bc1fa193 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1b790901/uploads/origins/d160404d-e724-49ed-86c2-ee94e6cd684c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cc93fbf60692b45c856129f4d074c531 3x"}, "body": "こんにちは、お元気でしょうか。\n私のオリジナルキャラクター2人を使って依頼をしたい。\nアラブの富豪貴族マグノリア夫人と、彼女の忠実な使用人ロイ。\nマグノリアが地面に座り、その横にロイが膝の上に頭を乗せているほのぼのとしたシーンを描いてほしい。二人はきれいな草原にいる。\nロイは生きているのではなく、腐敗し、ウジ虫だらけの死体である。\n マグノリアはまるで気づいていないかのように気にせず、満足そうな表情で彼の頭を撫でている。\n稚拙な文法で申し訳ない。\n\nhttps://imgchest.com/p/xny8mnnd7bl", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Otkaresama/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1991228, "client_id": 2928251, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/40ba81b3/uploads/origins/039d30a0-4be8-4068-aba1-c2bdc1e98e96?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=04ef030897e4db437bb812e819b36ee9", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/40ba81b3/uploads/origins/039d30a0-4be8-4068-aba1-c2bdc1e98e96?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=04ef030897e4db437bb812e819b36ee9, https://si.imgix.net/40ba81b3/uploads/origins/039d30a0-4be8-4068-aba1-c2bdc1e98e96?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=243cc2fe2f6c183cb67196ff1f2bd6c8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/40ba81b3/uploads/origins/039d30a0-4be8-4068-aba1-c2bdc1e98e96?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=28e8e7a64b619327a1e414eb654b1506 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/40ba81b3/uploads/origins/039d30a0-4be8-4068-aba1-c2bdc1e98e96?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1a81343af55f63697abb5cdac7fa80e5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/40ba81b3/uploads/origins/039d30a0-4be8-4068-aba1-c2bdc1e98e96?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1a81343af55f63697abb5cdac7fa80e5, https://si.imgix.net/40ba81b3/uploads/origins/039d30a0-4be8-4068-aba1-c2bdc1e98e96?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5be40f885b37140b3020656c556fdef6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/40ba81b3/uploads/origins/039d30a0-4be8-4068-aba1-c2bdc1e98e96?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b5fee01c822814688f8abb1e63b5ef34 3x"}, "body": "こんにちは、つららさん！\n私はあなたの作品がとても大好きです！\nあなたの構図とダークな雰囲気は本当に印象的です。\n私のオリジナルキャラクター、ルシウスを描いていただけませんか？\n\nルシウス｜177cm｜善でも悪でもない、いつも無邪気な笑顔を浮かべている悪魔のような吸血鬼。即興俳優のように、彼のイメージは人それぞれ。抽象的な夢、あるいはおとぎ話の登場人物に近い。彼の本性は誘惑的だが、禁断の果実のように食べられない。\n\n半透明のワインボトルに囲まれたルシウスを描いていただけませんか？\nその中には蛇のシルエットが閉じ込められている。\n可能であれば、めまいの要素を取り入れてもらえないだろうか。\nそれ以外のシーンは、あなたが決めてください。あなたの創造的な裁量を信じます。\n\nポーズはあなた次第です！\n服装はシンプルにしても変えても構いません。血の表現もOKです。\nご検討のほど、よろしくお願いいたします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1cIbmPZ8-T2c0KVP5ZI9qFUDwwr-9RzKG?usp=drive_link", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Otkaresama/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1991228, "client_id": 2940244, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2f007aef/uploads/origins/15702893-f0ce-4517-936f-d3a366a87a4d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=70c953e02016d610933f3de07edec913", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2f007aef/uploads/origins/15702893-f0ce-4517-936f-d3a366a87a4d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=70c953e02016d610933f3de07edec913, https://si.imgix.net/2f007aef/uploads/origins/15702893-f0ce-4517-936f-d3a366a87a4d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=efbc4a034e9dca31fb3bde0d02b85f33 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2f007aef/uploads/origins/15702893-f0ce-4517-936f-d3a366a87a4d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d2d1706708e53fb4ba3857f41b5a6c20 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2f007aef/uploads/origins/15702893-f0ce-4517-936f-d3a366a87a4d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6defba7c90d8763d68e90126ffc860b1", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2f007aef/uploads/origins/15702893-f0ce-4517-936f-d3a366a87a4d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6defba7c90d8763d68e90126ffc860b1, https://si.imgix.net/2f007aef/uploads/origins/15702893-f0ce-4517-936f-d3a366a87a4d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=826de44b1db2f3b55c8830d492ead4d6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2f007aef/uploads/origins/15702893-f0ce-4517-936f-d3a366a87a4d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bd4a2fb1d3da01d4cda85901c302ff1b 3x"}, "body": "I want to request a commission for the cover art of psychological horror game that I work on, which is about theme of life reflection and being stuck in a depressing cycle. As a teenager, Sing teen becomes entrapped in a loop of gaming, drugs, and friends that ultimately lead him down a path of suffering and regret in his later years (when he's old). In his final moments (Sing old), before he kills himself, he creates a character in his mind called Dan. Players will navigate the game as Dan, delving deeper into levels that gradually reveal clues, enabling them to understand and reflect upon Sing's life and choices.\n\nThe cover art should be about being stuck in a depressing cycle and reflecting on life, featuring the four main characters (or not, up to you). For this, I am open to your creative interpretation and any design or composition that effectively conveys the game's core themes.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1l9D6FMVxoSunscKKQedbxihxGwXUWE0F?usp=sharing", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Otkaresama/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1991228, "client_id": 988807, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/551fea76/uploads/origins/34ed0ec2-82e3-4e1c-9bb6-9d53fe078cfb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=286d300fc380b257ef08921c279ba5ef", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/551fea76/uploads/origins/34ed0ec2-82e3-4e1c-9bb6-9d53fe078cfb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=286d300fc380b257ef08921c279ba5ef, https://si.imgix.net/551fea76/uploads/origins/34ed0ec2-82e3-4e1c-9bb6-9d53fe078cfb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b775cb1f0107bd1a9af5338b1c745e4f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/551fea76/uploads/origins/34ed0ec2-82e3-4e1c-9bb6-9d53fe078cfb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4569ac87fd7303d07575f916328c449e 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/551fea76/uploads/origins/34ed0ec2-82e3-4e1c-9bb6-9d53fe078cfb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cd439c0b5a7fd101cae6f33494b117d6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/551fea76/uploads/origins/34ed0ec2-82e3-4e1c-9bb6-9d53fe078cfb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cd439c0b5a7fd101cae6f33494b117d6, https://si.imgix.net/551fea76/uploads/origins/34ed0ec2-82e3-4e1c-9bb6-9d53fe078cfb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=013d47d7703ba6932fd4b34c5ed99d2c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/551fea76/uploads/origins/34ed0ec2-82e3-4e1c-9bb6-9d53fe078cfb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5ce06033aa7aa7c0af4c3d710d833f9d 3x"}, "body": "こんにちは。あなたの作品に出会えてよかったです。質感や雰囲気がとても綺麗でとても気に入っています!\n私のキャラクター「フレスコ」のイラストをお願いします。彼は不安なシマウマの男の子です。体中に傷や目がたくさんあります。ゴミ箱の中にいるフレスコを描いていただけるとかわいいです。変なお願いですみません。ただ、あなたの作品の質感と色彩がぴったりだと思うのです!!!\n\nとにかく、暗い路地裏にあるゴミ箱がいいです!近くに壊れた街灯がぼんやり照らしているかもしれません。彼はその中でゴミ袋を持って座っていることでしょう。フレスコはこのことを悲しんで心配しています。\n\nhttps://meatzone.carrd.co/#fresco\n\nありがとうございました!\n\nhttps://meatzone.carrd.co/#fresco", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Otkaresama/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1991228, "client_id": 1699615, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f7f53fd8/uploads/origins/822b2526-4ff8-495e-941c-c0be6fc4701c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8c03a51a0ede7f4990eb1bc01352a2f0", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f7f53fd8/uploads/origins/822b2526-4ff8-495e-941c-c0be6fc4701c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8c03a51a0ede7f4990eb1bc01352a2f0, https://si.imgix.net/f7f53fd8/uploads/origins/822b2526-4ff8-495e-941c-c0be6fc4701c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b806032aa0e2957d67a26278a329921b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f7f53fd8/uploads/origins/822b2526-4ff8-495e-941c-c0be6fc4701c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b9e9125c41f8574550d74813873f0b0d 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f7f53fd8/uploads/origins/822b2526-4ff8-495e-941c-c0be6fc4701c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7bbad067ec45cfe2a371d5cc7e110121", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f7f53fd8/uploads/origins/822b2526-4ff8-495e-941c-c0be6fc4701c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7bbad067ec45cfe2a371d5cc7e110121, https://si.imgix.net/f7f53fd8/uploads/origins/822b2526-4ff8-495e-941c-c0be6fc4701c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d13c346fc81089252b0ca739f9d320e2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f7f53fd8/uploads/origins/822b2526-4ff8-495e-941c-c0be6fc4701c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c01bec39eaf32abf90ef2764c6eb360c 3x"}, "body": "Hi! I really like the atmosphere in your drawing! That dark and mysterious feeling is great! Would you mind drawing my character, a boy who lived a long time?\n\nThis boy is vivacious and outgoing, has a lot of strength, and sometimes is cruel and bloodthirsty. He loved to dissect, eat meat, and collect all kinds of specimens.\n\nI hope you can choose the content you are interested in from the following scenes:\n1. Strange and bloody dinner in a fancy restaurant\n2. Shared a room with many cute but bloody and creepy dolls\n\nI'm looking forward to seeing an interesting composition! Please feel free to draw.\n\nIf you do not want to accept this request, please do not hesitate to cancel it, many thanks!!><\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1UP6uH9hgw8H_WlmBFgOaKdDB0S9uODOQ?usp=sharing", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Otkaresama/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f6cdd4c4/uploads/origins/db01b6c3-3b08-4fd5-894a-e4f5bb0cf9c6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=mi